{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14229191","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14229191","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422919101:1":{"text":"どうです？これなら、誰もウソだとは思いませんよね？","source_cn":"这样写可以吗？不会被当成骗子吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95BF51C8DA10FAAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1422919101":{"text":"どうです？これなら、誰もウソだとは思いませんよね？","source_cn":"这样写可以吗？不会被当成骗子吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95BF51C8DA10FAAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422919102:1":{"text":"良かった！騙しの手口の例が少ない気もしますが、初心者への忠告なら十分かと。","source_cn":"那就好！虽然骗术这块罗列得有些简单，提示新手应该够了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x452D1EBF0A06CA81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"良かった！騙しの手口の例が少ない気もしますが、初心者への忠告なら十分かと。","female":"良かった！騙しの手口の例が少ない気もしますが、初心者への忠告なら十分かと。","variant_male_record_index":"169664","variant_female_record_index":"169665","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422919105:1":{"text":"若者の勢いってのも、時には悪くないねえ……これが広まれば、釣りで詐欺を働こうとする連中も暫くは大人しくなるだろうさ。","source_cn":"年轻人的冲劲有时也是好事啊……这份指南散发出去后，借着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4999FED154D9C838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422919106:1":{"text":"それから、ごめんなお嬢さん。若いからって、大した腕もないだろうって決めつけて悪かったよ。","source_cn":"我也跟你道个歉，不应该看你年纪轻轻就质疑你的钓鱼技术。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE65332AE6D1B